# apps/api — environment pointers
#
# Full local template (Docker + all services): copy repo root `.env.example` to `.env`.
# JWT, CORS, DB, email, and base URLs validated at API startup by `parseApiRuntimeEnv`
# in `packages/shared/src/api-env.ts` (loaded via `apps/api/src/config/api-runtime.ts`).
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google OAuth (read directly by `GoogleOAuthService` — not in `apiEnvKeys`)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Both must be set for `GET /api/v1/auth/google` to redirect to Google.
# Google Cloud Console “Authorized redirect URI” must match:
#   {API_BASE_URL}/api/v1/auth/google/callback
# (see `apps/api/src/auth/google-oauth.service.ts`; `API_BASE_URL` from shared parser.)
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
